\cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Gerry\'92s phone rang. CEO Dunhilton\'92s voice was almost cheerful. \'93I thought it would be more dramatic,\'94 Dunhilton complained.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Gerry sighed. He\'92d argued for a smaller dose to allow some of the infected to get away and pass it on. Dunhilton wanted to send a message, and the message was for himself, so he could be satisfied there was a massacre.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93The board is watching the live feed up here, Gerry. No one has popped the champagne.\'94\
